    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Version 3 of the Have I Been Pwned API. Authenticated APIs for breaches by account, pastes, domain search, domain verification, stealer logs, and subscription status require both the hibp-api-key and user-agent headers. Availability varies by subscription tier and is noted per operation. The Pwned Passwords range API is free and does not require authentication.",
